    resolves, Normal Summon 1 Level 4 or lower monster, also you cannot Special Summon
    monsters from the Extra Deck for the rest of this turn, except Synchro Monsters.
    You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 Synchro Monster you control;
    reduce its Level by up to 4.'
